{
  "bodyHash": "BGNQp58nZTY=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模组。用心制作。为 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 准备了大量活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">树收割者是一款可配置的模组，允许通过砍倒一个基础方块来瞬间收割树木、诡异树木和巨型蘑菇。这可以是树的任何部分。树苗会自动使用树木掉落物进行替换。模组内置了许多检查机制，从防止意外收割由原木建造的房屋，到控制树叶的凋落。<br><br>默认情况下，收割功能仅在按下潜行键时生效，但可在配置中切换。更多功能示例请见下方。提供大量配置选项，可按您的喜好精确调整模组。<br><br>开发时与我的 <a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ore-harvester\" rel=\"nofollow\">矿石收割者</a> 模组配合使用。</span><br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>默认配置下的功能：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>所有树木（包括原版和模组添加的）均可通过潜行并砍倒一个方块快速收割。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>砍树所需时间由树木中木材的数量决定。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>收割一棵树后，树叶会快速凋落。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>最后一片树叶凋落后，树苗会被自动替换。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>下界中的诡异树木也可快速收割。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>巨型蘑菇同样可以快速收割。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>可通过黑名单免除特定类型的斧子进行树木收割。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>包含多种检查以判断是否为树木，避免意外摧毁房屋。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>当两种树木相邻时，仅被破坏的树木的树叶会凋落。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>与其他模组兼容。</span></p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含于《原版体验》整合包\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含于 Serilum 的生活质量合集\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"环境：服务器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的配置选项：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>mustHoldAxeForTreeHarvest</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，树木收割仅当玩家主手持有斧子时生效。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>treeHarvestWithoutSneak</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，树木收割在不按潜行键时生效。禁用则相反，仅潜行时生效。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>automaticallyFindBottomBlock</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否让模组尝试找到树木实际最底部的原木并从那里开始。这意味着你可以在树木中间破坏一个方块，整棵树仍会被完全砍倒。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableFastLeafDecay</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，被破坏树木周围的树叶会快速消失。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableNetherTrees</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，下界中的诡异菌柄/绯红树木也会被快速砍倒。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableHugeMushrooms</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，巨型/大型蘑菇也会被快速砍倒。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>ignorePlayerMadeTrees</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，玩家放置树叶的树木不会被破坏。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>replaceSaplingOnTreeHarvest</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，在收割树木时自动从掉落物中替换树苗。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>replaceMushroomOnMushroomHarvest</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，在收割巨型蘑菇时自动从掉落物中替换蘑菇（前提是启用了 'enableHugeMushrooms'）。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>loseDurabilityPerHarvestedLog</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，每收割一根原木，持有的斧子会消耗耐久度。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>loseDurabilityModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 1.0, 最小值 0.001, 最大值 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">此处可设置砍倒一棵树消耗斧子多少耐久度。例如设置为 0.1 时，每 10 根原木消耗 1 点耐久度。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increaseExhaustionPerHarvestedLog</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，玩家每收割一根原木，饥饿度消耗增加 0.005（Minecraft 默认每破坏一个方块增加的消耗量）* increaseExhaustionModifier。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increaseExhaustionModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 1.0, 最小值 0.001, 最大值 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">此值决定每收割一根原木需为玩家增加多少饥饿度消耗。默认值为 0.005 * 1.0。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increaseHarvestingTimePerLog</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，收割时间将随树中原木数量增加而延长。增加量由 'increasedHarvestingTimePerLogModifier' 决定。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increasedHarvestingTimePerLogModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 0.1, 最小值 0.01, 最大值 10.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">当启用 'increaseHarvestingTimePerLog' 时，收割一棵树所需的时间延长多少。实际速度为：新速度 = 原速度 / (1 + (原木数量 * increasedHarvestingTimePerLogModifier))。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>amountOfLeavesBrokenPerTick</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 3, 最小值 1, 最大值 16</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">树木被收割后，每游戏刻（tick）应破坏多少片树叶。增加此值可加速快速落叶，但每 tick 会消耗更多处理性能。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>斧子黑名单功能：</strong></span><br>可以设置仅允许特定类型的斧子进行树木收割。模组首次加载时会生成一个黑名单文件。它位于 <strong><em>./config/treeharvester/harvestable_axe_blacklist.txt</em></strong>。此功能也适用于模组添加的斧子物品。<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/blacklist.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>收割一棵白桦树，旁边有一棵橡树。只有白桦树的树叶在凋落：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/birch_only.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>一棵大橡树：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/big_oak_only.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>一棵 2x2 云杉树。破坏树木所需时间更长，且 4 棵树苗均被正确替换：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/big_spruce.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>适用于诡异（下界）树木：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/nether_tree.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>也适用于巨型蘑菇，这是一颗棕色蘑菇：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/brown_mushroom.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>这是一颗红色蘑菇：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/red_mushroom.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以在任何整合包中自由使用此模组，只要下载仍托管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统中。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有可用模组的概览和更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">评论功能已禁用，因为我无法在众多独立的模组页面中跟踪它们。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他事宜，请访问 <a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 仓库</a>。感谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
